# No environment variables are required for the standard setup.
#
# In development: the API is proxied through Vite (vite.config.js → /api → localhost:8080).
# In Docker:      the API is proxied through nginx (nginx.conf → /api → backend:8080).
#
# If you need to override the API base URL for a custom deployment, add:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend-domain.com
